# who has Grizzly Bears (2/2) and Elvish Mystic (1/1). The Bears (power 2) may not block the Pet (power 1) - refused - but the
# Mystic (power 1, not greater) may; and the Bears may block the Lions, which the restriction does not cover. The Mystic dies to the
# Pet's 1 damage and the Pet survives its 1; the Bears and the Lions trade (both die).

